{"4792260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood of Rations", "steam_appid": 4792260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/76713d9089a6857619037fd3924774cc.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Out here, there's one thing <u>worth surviving</u> for: <u>getting home</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every <u>weapon</u>, every <u>ration</u>, every <u>scrap</u> you drag back makes your <u>bunker stronger</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everyone else on the <u>map</u> wants to make sure you <u>never get there</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/ab2586f7fb8675dd21167e56d5a329a2.avif?t=1783626803\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What is Blood of Rations?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/49b11241393f1948e1161f86c8d1ea21.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blood of Rations</strong> is a <strong>first-person WW2 PvPvE extraction shooter</strong> set on the <strong>European front, 1944</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You <strong>deploy</strong> alone into the night, <strong>scavenge</strong> what you can <strong>carry</strong>, and <strong>fight whoever</strong> — and whatever — you meet on   the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything you <strong>extract</strong>, you <strong>keep</strong>. Everything you leave behind is <strong>gone for good</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/90c80380a02e98a13111161b4d0f5892.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ardennes Airfield, </strong>1944<strong>.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dead airfield under a black sky — and you are <strong>not alone</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deserters</strong> already work the field: some <strong>loot</strong> quietly, some patrol with <strong>rifles up</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other <strong>players</strong> do both. No objectives, no commanders, no medals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just what you can carry, and the way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/901382defbbefdf4213f86a270453440.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Tetris grid is your only carry limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>can of peaches</strong> is a win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>legendary rarity MG42</strong> is a story you'll tell tomorrow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>extract</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/242a26461d8c6677498a9f4a227ba126.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>leave</strong>, light a <strong>green flare</strong> and stand in it — the only <strong>bright color</strong> for miles — for <strong>eight long seconds</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone</strong> still alive can see exactly <strong>where you are</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hardest part of any <strong>raid is the last eight</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/63b1ed9a42fdf38d3c553ae64b83cd07.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between raids you <strong>build</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thirteen stations</strong> to <strong>repair</strong> and <strong>upgrade</strong> from what you <strong>drag home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eat</strong> before you <strong>deploy</strong>, or deploy weak. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>bunker</strong> is the only <strong>warm place left</strong> in the world — and <strong>reaching it is the point</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/c6bec8bc3df6b96820e5db7fd027a9fb.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No minimap</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No enemy markers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>sound</strong> is <strong>diegetic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boots ringing on a hangar roof, canvas tearing as you <strong>search a corpse</strong>, the <strong>M1 Garand's clip</strong> pinging into the dark to tell everyone <strong>you're out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/976a0405b582db633812333422cde0bf.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Now in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blood of Rations</strong> is being built by <strong>one developer</strong> with a studio from <strong>Norway</strong>. <strong>Wishlist &amp; follow</strong> development and be notified when the <strong>game is available</strong>. Devlog here: <strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/9bcdea8696d42cbcdf90d5ef69d1d8fb.avif?t=1783626803\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If this is the kind of <strong>extraction shooter</strong> you've been waiting for </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">one that respects the <strong>weight of each raid</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">the <strong>cost of each death</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and the earned <strong>warmth of coming home</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">in a <strong>WW2 Setting</strong>, then you have <strong><u>found it</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/b6ad13086d6fb343c81bcd04f0a226ef.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/a0bdd862db9626844845397db18606dc.avif?t=1783626803\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/76713d9089a6857619037fd3924774cc.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Out here, there's one thing <u>worth surviving</u> for: <u>getting home</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every <u>weapon</u>, every <u>ration</u>, every <u>scrap</u> you drag back makes your <u>bunker stronger</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everyone else on the <u>map</u> wants to make sure you <u>never get there</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/ab2586f7fb8675dd21167e56d5a329a2.avif?t=1783626803\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What is Blood of Rations?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/49b11241393f1948e1161f86c8d1ea21.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blood of Rations</strong> is a <strong>first-person WW2 PvPvE extraction shooter</strong> set on the <strong>European front, 1944</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You <strong>deploy</strong> alone into the night, <strong>scavenge</strong> what you can <strong>carry</strong>, and <strong>fight whoever</strong> — and whatever — you meet on   the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything you <strong>extract</strong>, you <strong>keep</strong>. Everything you leave behind is <strong>gone for good</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/90c80380a02e98a13111161b4d0f5892.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ardennes Airfield, </strong>1944<strong>.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dead airfield under a black sky — and you are <strong>not alone</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deserters</strong> already work the field: some <strong>loot</strong> quietly, some patrol with <strong>rifles up</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other <strong>players</strong> do both. No objectives, no commanders, no medals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just what you can carry, and the way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/901382defbbefdf4213f86a270453440.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Tetris grid is your only carry limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>can of peaches</strong> is a win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>legendary rarity MG42</strong> is a story you'll tell tomorrow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>extract</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/242a26461d8c6677498a9f4a227ba126.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></sp