ss=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/976a0405b582db633812333422cde0bf.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Now in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blood of Rations</strong> is being built by <strong>one developer</strong> with a studio from <strong>Norway</strong>. <strong>Wishlist &amp; follow</strong> development and be notified when the <strong>game is available</strong>. Devlog here: <strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/9bcdea8696d42cbcdf90d5ef69d1d8fb.avif?t=1783626803\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If this is the kind of <strong>extraction shooter</strong> you've been waiting for </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">one that respects the <strong>weight of each raid</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">the <strong>cost of each death</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and the earned <strong>warmth of coming home</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">in a <strong>WW2 Setting</strong>, then you have <strong><u>found it</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/b6ad13086d6fb343c81bcd04f0a226ef.avif?t=1783626803\" width=1232 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/extras/a0bdd862db9626844845397db18606dc.avif?t=1783626803\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A first-person PvPvE WW2 extraction looter shooter. Slip alone into a war-torn Europe to scavenge what the dead left behind. Hunt loot. Fight deserters and strangers. Extract alive — or lose it all. Every raid begins in your warm, safe bunker. If you're lucky, it ends there too.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/88fa38777471f6092c9c54d0833ec9c19d35666a/header.jpg?t=1783626803", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/f1834d63cb4ae82817baf8ec87f688061f032c34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783626803", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792260/f1834d63cb4ae82817baf8ec87f688061f032c34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783626803", "website": "https://bloodofrations.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (21H2+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-8350 (4-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 4 GB / AMD Radeon R9 380 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a persistent broadband internet connection — online-only PvPvE, no offline mode. 64-bit OS required. SSD strongly recommended for raid load times</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l